 "remarks": "Enjoy downtown Stamford living in this two-bedroom, one-bath condominium located on the fifth floor. The unit features an open-concept living and dining area and a private balcony offering outdoor space and sunset views.  Community amenities include 24-hour gated security, an outdoor pool, laundry facilities, and a fitness room. The unit includes one unassigned outdoor parking space. Monthly HOA includes heat, hot water, cable, and internet; buyers should confirm all inclusions community rules with the association.  Conveniently located less than a 10-minute walk from downtown Stamford's restaurants and entertainment, the property is also near public transportation, healthcare, and Stamford High School. Stamford Transportation Center is approximately 1.5 miles away.",
